            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Long non-coding RNAs (lncRNAs) have been implicated in numerous developmental processes. In a technical and bioinformatics tour-de-force, He et al. (2017) provide critical insight into the dynamics of lncRNA expression, function, and mechanism during oligodendrocyte development and after injury.</AbstractText>
